{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"score\": 3, \"why\": \"概括了贯穿始终的核心矛盾：他想承认自己的愿望、作出选择并承担责任，却始终受到对他人的在意、对后悔的恐惧及渴望被理解等多重需要的牵扯。结尾也呈现了关键转变：他不再把再次动摇视为此前努力的失败，而是学着在怀疑中重新辨认愿望、顾虑与代价，并带着矛盾行动。同时，概括明确指出内在冲突和未来可能的后悔仍未消失，体现了他对反复选择与承担责任的新理解。虽然没有直接点明他最初将坚定视为必须毫无迟疑、永不改变的自我证明，但已充分呈现这一观念转变的关键内涵及其未完成性。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "92dd6c49-d5d8-4fd0-8a82-5d4c48ddbe1a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261021T071758168610Z", "elapsed_seconds": 13.313, "completed_utc": "2026-10-21T07:18:11.487809+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "339b7961ee9bf8bcd297c75fd8f60449e967f77480dca0af5a20662de5429199", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "722a90984d40295e55caba596589f01b85b2b784e2b74dd51fb8de09bf479560", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechai